In summary, the robots of _Stray_ have a lively and unique musical culture. It
features elements of their identity as robots, elements of their history with
humanity, and elements of the environment they exist in. This culture is
experienced through consumption, performance, and composition. The player
experiences all three of these elements through diegetic music during their
play through of the game. They serve as a narrative device to emphasize the
robots' role as a continuation of humanity.
